  "visual": {
    "visualType": "textbox",
    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The electricity generation mix of Great Britain and its carbon intensity in every half-hour of 2025, as published by the National Grid ESO's Carbon Intensity API: 17,494 of the 17,520 half-hours (the API has gaps) and one row for each fuel, so the same half-hour appears once per fuel. Carbon intensity is the grams of carbon dioxide emitted for each kilowatt-hour generated (the actual value; 18 half-hours have no forecast). Shares are shares of all generation in Great Britain, including imports. Coal and the category other were zero all year and are not shown; hydro appears in the data but is almost always zero, because the API does not report it as a separate fuel. Renewable here means wind, solar and hydro; low-carbon also counts nuclear and biomass.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How to use it",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Open the Filters pane on the right (the funnel tab) to filter by category or date; the selection applies to every page. Click a bar, a slice or a point to cross-filter the other charts, and hover over one to see a small summary card.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Data source",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Carbon Intensity API (National Grid ESO and partners), https://api.carbonintensity.org.uk/, licensed under CC BY 4.0, retrieved on 25 October 2026 (generation mix and actual intensity, 1 January to 31 December 2025, UTC). Prepared: the two feeds were joined by half-hour, the long table has one row per half-hour and fuel, and hour, part of the day, weekday, weekend, month, season, source type and an intensity index were added.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Measures",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Fuel records = COUNTROWS(UKGrid)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Half-hours = DISTINCTCOUNT(UKGrid[Slot])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Average carbon intensity (g per kWh) = AVERAGE(UKGrid[Intensity_actual])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Renewable share = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]), UKGrid[Source_type] = \"Renewable\"), SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Low-carbon share = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]), UKGrid[Source_type] = \"Renewable\" || UKGrid[Source_type] = \"Nuclear\" || UKGrid[Source_type] = \"Biomass\"), SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Gas share = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]), UKGrid[Fuel] = \"Gas\"), SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Wind share = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]), UKGrid[Fuel] = \"Wind\"), SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Solar share = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]), UKGrid[Fuel] = \"Solar\"), SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Imports share = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]), UKGrid[Fuel] = \"Imports\"), SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Nuclear share = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]), UKGrid[Fuel] = \"Nuclear\"), SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Cleanest half-hour (g per kWh) = MIN(UKGrid[Intensity_actual])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Dirtiest half-hour (g per kWh) = MAX(UKGrid[Intensity_actual])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Average share of generation = SUM(UKGrid[Share_pct]) / (DISTINCTCOUNT(UKGrid[Slot]) * 100)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Clean half-hours = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(DISTINCTCOUNT(UKGrid[Slot]), UKGrid[Intensity_index] = \"1 Very low\" || UKGrid[Intensity_index] = \"2 Low\"), DISTINCTCOUNT(UKGrid[Slot]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#F1EEFF"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
